## Key Decisions

1. **STR label**: Removed "(STR)" suffix; strChoice default changed from empty to 'no' so field shows "No" on load

2. **Header rescale**: Desktop nav wrapped in max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-4 inner div; outer container drops px-6/px-8 — header aligns flush with form cards

3. **Acreage dropdown**: Added to Property Details after 5+ Units; new acreage: string in LoanData + DEFAULT_FORM_DATA; values: less than 5 (default), 6-10, 10-15, 15-20, greater than 20

4. **Vacant dropdown**: Added to Investor Details; new isVacant: boolean (default false); hidden when loanPurpose === 'purchase'

5. **Prepay Period labels**: Values kept (60mo/48mo/36mo/24mo/12mo/0mo); display text changed to 5 Year / 4 Year / 3 Year / 2 Year / 1 Year / None. Results bar pill updated via lookup map.

6. **Prepay Type list**: Changed to 5% / 3% / 6 Mo. Interest / Declining 3yr (3-2-1%). prepayPctMap: 6mo-interest and declining-3yr both map to '3'

7. **CRITICAL Results Fix**:
   - Rate dedup (Step 1): After merging same-named programs, rate options deduplicated by rate value, keeping best price per rate. Prevents 5+5=10 doubled rows.
   - DSCR filter (Step 3): Removed forced '5' from wantedPpps — only shows selectedPct program. Removed shouldPinDSCR5Pct; pinned = false always in broker view.

8. **Accent colors**: All #38BDF8 sky-blue changed to #245F73: Get Pricing button, QuinnGlow Q, email borders, share panel header. CSS tokens --color-blue-500/600 and --tql-link updated to #245F73.

